Output demo.gif

Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1280
Set Height 720
Set Padding 18
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 90ms
Set Framerate 18

Hide
Type "clear" Enter
Sleep 1s
Show

Type "otacli"
Sleep 700ms
Enter

# environment check, then the main menu
Sleep 8s

# what's trending right now
Down@350ms 4
Sleep 700ms
Enter
Sleep 6s
Ctrl+C
Sleep 2500ms

# Search -> By title
Enter
Sleep 1800ms
Enter
Sleep 1500ms

# the list filters as you type
Type@110ms "frieren"
Sleep 1500ms
Down@450ms 2
Sleep 1200ms
Up@450ms 2
Sleep 1000ms

# open it: cover art, synopsis, score, genres, episode count
Enter
Sleep 12s
